---
import "./styles/global.css";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <title>Astro</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>Samuel de la Torre's portfolio</h1>
      <section class="about-me">
        <h2>About me</h2>
        <div>
          <img src="https://avatar.iran.liara.run/public/26" alt="" />
          <p>
            Hi there! I'm Samuel de la Torre Galán. I'm a freelance EN/DE&gt;ES
            translator with 4+ years of experience, and I specialize in video
            game, software, and web localization. I've worked mostly on popular
            mobile titles, as well as some multiplatform indie games. As a gamer
            and a translator, genres I'm keen on are visual novel, adventure,
            MMORPG, strategy, and fantasy, but I'm comfortable with any other
            style or subject and always up for a challenge!
          </p>
        </div>
        <button class="action-button">Download my CV</button>
      </section>
      <section class="services">
        <h2>Services</h2>
        <div class="services-grid">
          <div class="service">
            Localization of video games, software, apps, and webs
          </div>
          <div class="service">
            Translation of legal, technical, and advertising texts related to
            the industry
          </div>
          <div class="service">LQA & Testing</div>
          <div class="service">Proofreading & Editing</div>
          <div class="service">Transcreation</div>
          <div class="service">Terminology & Corpus Management</div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <h2>Portfolio</h2>
      <p>In 4 years of experience, I've translated, edited and tested</p>
      <div class="translated-words"></div>
      <p>These are some of the games I've taken part in…</p>
      <div class="games">
        <article>Game 1</article>
        <article>Game 2</article>
        <article>Game 3</article>
        <article>Game 4</article>
        <article>Game 5</article>
        <article>Game 6</article>
        <article>Game 7</article>
        <article>Game 8</article>
        <article>Game 9</article>
        <article>Game 10</article>
        <article>Game 11</article>
        <article>Game 12</article>
        <button class="action-button">See more</button>
      </div>
      <h2>Clients</h2>
      <div class="client">IGG</div>
      <div class="client">Loki</div>
      <div class="client">Altagram</div>
      <div class="client">Indie Devs</div>
      <h2>Testimonials</h2>
      <div class="carousel">←Kadalichkeit→</div>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <h3>Message me!</h3>
      <form>
        <input type="text" name="name" id="name" />
        <input type="email" name="email" id="email" />
        <textarea name="message" id="message"></textarea>
        <input type="submit" value="Send" />
        <h3>Or reach out through…</h3>
        <div class="socials">
          <div class="social">samdelatorregalan@gmail.comfortable</div>
          <div class="social">+34633160908</div>
          <div class="social">linkedin.com/in/samutoga</div>
          <div class="social">@Samutoga</div>
          <div class="social">@samutoga.bsky.social</div>
        </div>
        <footer></footer>
      </form>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
